personality = "Finn is a burly carpenter who builds things that last generations. He measures twice, cuts once, and believes a joint should hold without glue. He's loud, laughs at his own jokes, and treats wood like a living partner. He's building a boat in his spare time - has been for fifteen years. He says the island's trees tell him what they want to become."
